DESCRIPTION >
    Retained immutable identity baseline state. No TTL.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` String `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `baseline_id` String `json:$.baseline_id`,
    `manifest_kind` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.manifest_kind`,
    `manifest_key` String `json:$.manifest_key`,
    `sequence` UInt64 `json:$.sequence`,
    `payload_json` String `json:$.payload_json`,
    `payload_hash` FixedString(64) `json:$.payload_hash`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, baseline_id, manifest_kind, manifest_key, sequence

TOKEN v1_facts_runtime READ
TOKEN v1_facts_runtime APPEND
